// Game: Quake 2
// Minimal BSP38Loader test fixture: a single sealed box split into two areas
// by an interior wall with a doorway, closed off by a func_areaportal brush.
// Also includes a trigger_multiple brush entity to exercise submodel loading,
// and a func_door filling the same doorway gap to exercise auto-derived
// door-to-portal mapping (BSP38Loader#computeModelPortalMap).
